TVLWeightedContainers::currentEpoch()
├── given epoch not started
│   └── it should revert with TVLWeightedContainersNotStarted
└── given epoch started
    ├── when current time equals initialized timestamp
    │   └── it should return zero
    ├── when current time is less than one epoch duration
    │   └── it should return zero
    ├── when current time spans multiple epochs
    │   ├── it should return correct epoch number for specific epochs (1, 5, 10, 11)
    │   └── it should handle partial epochs correctly
    ├── when testing boundary conditions
    │   ├── it should return correct epoch exactly at epoch boundary
    │   └── it should return correct epoch just before next epoch
    └── when using fuzz testing with random time offsets
        └── it should calculate epoch correctly for any valid time offset
